{"parentUuid":"fe48f93f-2f97-4a16-839d-97d592684cff","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"2482f072-2076-42fc-909a-54dfc1633ceb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"ok, now I would want to also list tokens and delete/revoke tokens. I guess a good prefix would be `entire auth` and then have `entire auth list` and `entire auth revoke` (or delete?) and alias login/logout there too (maybe move all commands under `auth` but keep aliases for login/logout).\n\nThoughts?"},"uuid":"13f6638a-aca3-4cfb-a061-49c4a24f0177","timestamp":"2026-04-27T15:58:03.406Z","permissionMode":"acceptEdits","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/cli","sessionId":"b8f6d643-d50f-43cc-b9e7-b5dfa6939c04","version":"2.1.119","gitBranch":"soph/token-improvements"}
