 %w\", err)\n\t}\n\treturn nil\n}\n\nfunc runLogout(ctx context.Context, outW, errW io.Writer, store logoutTokenStore, revoke logoutRevokeFunc, baseURL string) error {\n\ttoken, err := store.GetToken(baseURL)\n\tif err != nil {\n\t\t// Fall through to the local delete: we still want the keyring entry\n\t\t// gone, even if we couldn't read it well enough to revoke server-side.\n\t\tfmt.Fprintf(errW, \"Warning: failed to read token before revocation: %v\\n\", err)\n\t}\n\tif token != \"\" {\n\t\tif err := revoke(ctx, token); err != nil && !api.IsAPIErrorStatus(err, http.StatusUnauthorized) {\n\t\t\t// Best-effort: a transient network error shouldn't block local\n\t\t\t// logout. A 401 means the token is already invalid server-side,\n\t\t\t// so the desired state is achieved — no warning needed.\n\t\t\tfmt.Fprintf(errW, \"Warning: server-side token revocation failed: %v\\n\", err)\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\tif err := store.DeleteToken(baseURL); err != nil {\n\t\treturn fmt.Errorf(\"remove auth token: %w\", err)\n\t}\n\n\tfmt.Fprintln(outW, \"Logged out.\")\n\treturn nil\n}\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":48,"oldLines":7,"newStart":48,"newLines":7,"lines":["     fmt.Fprintf(errW, \"Warning: failed to read token before revocation: %v\\n\", err)","   }","   if token != \"\" {","-    if err := revoke(ctx, token); err != nil && !api.IsAPIErrorStatus(err, http.StatusUnauthorized) {","+    if err := revoke(ctx, token); err != nil && !api.IsHTTPErrorStatus(err, http.StatusUnauthorized) {","       // Best-effort: a transient network error shouldn't block local","       // logout. A 401 means the token is already invalid server-side,","       // so the desired state is achieved — no warning needed."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"68f0702b-c01e-49bf-8b56-fab51c3c4064","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/cli","sessionId":"b8f6d643-d50f-43cc-b9e7-b5dfa6939c04","version":"2.1.119","gitBranch":"soph/token-impr